    backlog:soThat "the claim 'this page works' is checked the same way the template's own build instructions require, AND the page genuinely represents this subject rather than silently carrying the prior one -- direct user finding: 'You write the definitions of done without considering the actual effect on the real artifacts.' The DoD as originally written checked the 5 reference criteria the template's build instructions name, but never asked whether sections outside the const-replacement mechanism's reach were clean; found real, disclosed content that fails exactly that unchecked question." ;
