    backlog:soThat "Cross.A/C are verified against what this Epic actually produces, not against a gate written for a structurally different artifact; RESCOPED from this Story's original text ('sync 21 sections to 25'), which assumed the old flowing-page's literal per-section structure. Confirmed by direct domain analysis (2026-08-31): the corpus contract's own schema (01-schema/corpus_contract_v1_0_0.json) organizes content as CATEGORIES > PRINCIPLES, a two-level hierarchy, not 25 flat page sections -- the original Story would have been the wrong fix for the artifact this Epic is actually building toward." ;
